/ A plain call (Parallel false by default) waits: it answers the goal's result, and what the goal wrote is there when
/ the next step runs.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Slow"); variable.set(Name=%got%, Value=%!data%)
- assert.equals(Expected="slow done", Actual=%got%, Message="a plain call answers the goal's result")
- assert.equals(Expected="slow", Actual=%wrote%, Message="the goal ended before the next step")

Slow
- timer.sleep(Ms=100)
- variable.set(Name=%wrote%, Value="slow")
- goal.return(Data="slow done")
